                                                "example_id": "832943c1-0db1-4d86-9bfc-3c41720fea1a",
                                                "sense_id": "72e89e4f-88b0-3257-9728-f4369998cb37",
                                                "text": "Even Lord Hendy, who was a Crossbencher until becoming Rail Minister last July, has begun to sound like an old Leftie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
